The '''Wretched Ghetto''' lies to the east of [[Alah'Thalas]]. It is the refuge of the [[withered]], elves who have succumbed to their addiction to the arcane in the absence of the [[Sunwell]]. Cast aside by elven society, they eke a meager living in their hovel under the leadership of [[Tenris Mirkblood]], the self-styled king of the Withered.

